   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Coimbatore/vindictive-arrest-by-tvk-government-was-meant-to-conceal-administrative-failure-says-ntk-functionary-karthika/article71615305.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
