   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "The culture minister said Friday his ministry will conduct a thorough audit of the former National Museum of Korea chief who resigned over the museum's controversial display of a misattributed calligraphic work from his private collection. You Hong-june stepped down earlier this week after the museum wrongly displayed the calligraphy in an exhibition as the work of a Korean independence activist.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国文化部长周五表示，该部将对前韩国国立中央博物馆馆长进行全面调查。此人因博物馆存在争议地展出其私人收藏中的一幅归属错误书法作品而辞职。柳洪俊本周早些时候辞职，此前博物馆在展览中错误地将这幅书法作品标为韩国独立activist的作品。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The culture minister said Friday his ministry will conduct a thorough audit of the former National Museum of Korea chief who resigned over the museum's controversial display of a misattributed calligraphic work from his private collection. You Hong-june stepped down earlier this week after the museum wrongly displayed the calligraphy in an exhibition as the work of a Korean independence activist. The piece was later identified as the work of a prominent pro-Japanese collaborator during Japan's 1910-45 colonial rule of Korea and turned out to be from You's own private collection. \"I think the incident has damaged the reputation and public trust the museum has built over the years,\" Culture Minister Chae Hwi-young told a lawmaker during a parliamentary audit of the ministry. \"The ministry will seek to restore public confidence through a rigorous investigation.\" The audit will not be limited to the alleged abuse of authority by the former director but will also look into \"every procedure involved in the management and authentication of the exhibit at issue,\" Chae added",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
