   "summary": "Lisa of K-pop girl group BLACKPINK returned to the music scene Friday with her new solo EP, \"Press Play,\" marking her first release in one year and eight months. The six-track album, released at midnight, serves as the singer's first solo EP and follows her debut full-length album, \"Alter Ego,\" which came out in February last year. The comeback follows a major milestone for Lisa at the 2026 MTV Video Music Awards in Los Angeles last month.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国女子组合BLACKPINK成员Lisa于周五携全新个人EP《Press Play》重返音乐界，这是她一年八个月以来的首次发行。这张包含6首歌曲的专辑于午夜发行，是这位歌手的首张个人EP，继去年2月推出的首张完整专辑《Alter Ego》之后再次归来。这次回归之前，Lisa于上月在洛杉矶举行的2026年MTV视频音乐奖上迎来重要里程碑。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Lisa of K-pop girl group BLACKPINK returned to the music scene Friday with her new solo EP, \"Press Play,\" marking her first release in one year and eight months. The six-track album, released at midnight, serves as the singer's first solo EP and follows her debut full-length album, \"Alter Ego,\" which came out in February last year. \"Sawadika,\" which was released ahead of the album in September, debuted at No. 69 on the Billboard Hot 100 chart shortly after its release. It set a new record as the highest-charting song from the artist. The comeback follows a major milestone for Lisa at the 2026 MTV Video Music Awards in Los Angeles last month. She won the Best Pop award, a major category, for \"Dream,\" a track from \"Alter Ego,\" becoming the first Asian solo artist to claim the prize",
