   "title": "Delinquency ratio on bank loans up for 2nd month in August",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/banking-finance/20261023/delinquency-ratio-on-bank-loans-up-for-2nd-month-in-august",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
