   "title": "Mysuru among 17 cities selected for street food hub as part of PM SVANidhi",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/mysuru-among-17-cities-selected-for-street-food-hub-as-part-of-pm-svanidhi/article71615635.ece",
