   "title": "Will US national VanDyke return to India? Court to hear case linked to Myanmar drone warfare on Friday",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/us-national-vandyke-ukrainians-myanmar-training-india-nia-probe-mizoram-court-hearing-news-101792634224199.html",
