   "title": "Top US envoy cites 'turbulence' in S. Korea-US alliance amid rift in security, trade priorities",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261021/top-us-envoy-cites-turbulence-in-s-korea-us-alliance-amid-rift-in-security-trade-priorities",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
