   "title": "Omokri receives Mexico’s agreement as Nigeria’s Ambassador",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/10/omokri-receives-mexicos-agrement-as-nigerias-ambassador/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
