   "title": "The full picture on Chinese export controls is sharper than just TBMs alone.",
   "url": "https://x.com/prasannavishy/status/2112796478381101426",
   "snippet": "The full picture on Chinese export controls is sharper than just TBMs alone.\n\nThe licence rule applies to exports to “sensitive countries and regions in dispute with China.” \n\nThe list also covers walking excavators and plateau shotcrete machines used above 3,000 metres.Basically the equipment that builds roads and tunnels as part of India's massive infrastructure buildout in Himalayas.\n\nBeijing has also put controls on drone autopilots and engines, and last week floated a draft to restrict 40+ technologies, including next-gen solar manufacturing. \n\nEvery sector where India is trying to cut dependence on China is now a chokepoint. \n\nJust need to face it and build it here, and build it fast. via @businessline",
   "body": "The full picture on Chinese export controls is sharper than just TBMs alone.\n\nThe licence rule applies to exports to “sensitive countries and regions in dispute with China.” \n\nThe list also covers walking excavators and plateau shotcrete machines used above 3,000 metres.Basically the equipment that builds roads and tunnels as part of India's massive infrastructure buildout in Himalayas.\n\nBeijing has also put controls on drone autopilots and engines, and last week floated a draft to restrict 40+ technologies, including next-gen solar manufacturing. \n\nEvery sector where India is trying to cut dependence on China is now a chokepoint. \n\nJust need to face it and build it here, and build it fast. via @businessline",
